Package: vulcan
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: PDF rendering service
 An HTTP API service that accepts base64-encoded HTML and returns
 PDF files generated using Puppeteer and Chrome headless shell.
 .
 The service runs as a long-lived systemd unit, listening for
 incoming PDF generation requests on a configurable port.
